The '''Nephrans''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[crustacean]] [[species]] that were [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[water]]-rich [[planet]] [[Nepotis]]. [[Thermoculus Krisintvolt Scissorpunch|Therm Scissorpunch]] was a member of this species.

==Biology and appearance==
[[File:Therm_Scissorpunch_SWCT.png|thumb|left|140px|A Nephran named Therm Scissorpunch.]]
The Nephran were a [[species]] of [[Color|olive green]] or orange colored skin and black [[eye]]s. The Nephrans had claws, tentacles attached to their head, and clawed feet.<ref name="Alien Archive" />

==History==
The Nephran [[Homeworld|hailed]] from the [[water]]-rich [[planet]] [[Nepotis]]. Besides this, not much was known about them or their homeworld.<ref name="Alien Archive" />

==Nephrans in the galaxy==
[[Acantha]] was a [[Gender|female]] Nephran who lived during the [[High Republic Era]] who was a member of the [[Norikus gang]] lead by a male [[Unidentified Octeroid|Octeroid]].<ref name="A Coruscant Solstice">{{StoryCite|story=A Coruscant Solstice|book=Life Day Treasury}}</ref> [[Thermoculus Krisintvolt Scissorpunch|Therm Scissorpunch]] was a male Nephran also active during the High Republic<ref name="THRA 1">[[The High Republic Adventures (2022) 1|''The High Republic Adventures'' (2022) 1]]</ref> who lived into the [[Imperial Era]]. Scissorpunch was known to frequent the card tables on the [[planet]] [[Vandor]].<ref name="Alien Archive" />

{{Gamemechanics|Star Wars Jedi: Survivor|canon=1}}
One Nephran frequented the [[holotactics]] table run by [[Bhima Ook]] and [[Tulli Mu]] at [[Pyloon's Saloon]] on the planet [[Koboh]], witnessing [[Jedi Knight]] [[Cal Kestis]] defeat several local residents at the [[hologame]].<ref name="Jedi Survivor">''[[Star Wars Jedi: Survivor]]''</ref>
{{Endgame}}

[[Mirack]] was a male Nephran who was part of a [[Grox's pirate crew|pirate crew]] lead by [[Grox]].<ref name="Luke & Leia Adventure">''[[Choose Your Destiny: A Luke & Leia Adventure]]''</ref>

